error[E4101]: cannot borrow `p.first` as mutable because it is also borrowed as shared
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_parent_then_child.tarn:30:10
   |
29 |     a := &p
   |          -- shared borrow of `p` starts here
30 |     b := &mut p.first
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ mutable borrow conflicts here
32 |     print(a.first.data)
   |           ------------ the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

